Since dtext is uniform on 2^text_len elements, the probability that v = t is 1/2^text_len. But there's also the 
check: we set TRF.mp[x] = v. After this, x is in fdom TRF.mp. But this doesn't affect the current run — only future 
queries. Wait, but the condition checks x \in TRF.mp. After setting TRF.mp[x] = v, future calls to gver with the same
     x will find it in TRF.mp and return false. But that's fine — it only REDUCES the probability of returning true. The 
