    1/2^text_len, so their difference is bounded by 1/2^text_len. Actually, since both are probabilities in [0, 
     1/2^text_len], the absolute difference is at most 1/2^text_len. Proof: |a - b| <= max(a, b) <= 1/2^text_len for 
